CKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #0900ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">강의평가 기간 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #0900ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: 2014. 11. 24.(</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #0900ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">월</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #0900ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">) 9:00 ~ 12. 22.(</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #0900ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">월</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #0900ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">) 18:00</span></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #0900ff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #0900ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #0900ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">○ </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #0900ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">참여방법 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #0900ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #0900ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">원스톱서비스 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #0900ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">- </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #0900ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학사관리 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #0900ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">- </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #0900ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">강의평가 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #0900ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">- </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #0900ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">강의평가서 작성</span></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">* </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">본 강의평가 설문에 대한 </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #f15f5f; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">익명성은 철저하게 보장이 되며</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #f15f5f; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #f15f5f; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학생이 평가한 결과는 성적부여에 영향을 미치지 않는 성적확정 이후에 해당 교수에게 열람됩니다</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #f15f5f; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #0900ff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #0900ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">* </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #0900ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">강의평가 기간 중에 평가를 실시하지 않은 학생은 해당 학기 성적열람기간에 성적을 열람할 수 없습니다</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #0900ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #ff00dd; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; \"\" </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #ff00dd; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">적극적인 참여를 부탁드립니다</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #ff00dd; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.\"\"</span></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%;